    {
      "claim": "The alerted transfer is corroborated: at 13:46:54 UTC the proxy recorded 640,000,000 client-to-server bytes in a CONNECT tunnel naming ingest.stratosafe-backup.com:443. Zeek recorded 640,000,448 outbound bytes on the corresponding connection from FILE-NWD-01 source port 63350 to the proxy.",
